   - Added explicit queue depth penalty (queue depth directly causes queueing delay)
   - Stronger cache hit rate boost for large inputs (0.35 vs 0.15) - this should help cache_warmup significantly
   - Earlier KV utilization penalty (0.7 vs 0.8) to proactively avoid memory-pressured instances
   - Better free KV block bonus for medium+ inputs (threshold 256 vs 512)
